Current L3 (71.7.0),Meter 1,holding,32,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,OBIS 71.7.0. Digits of the read-out value without the decimal point (e.g. 6895.2317 reads 68952317): apply the meter's decimals. 0 if not in the read-out
