Voltage L2 (52.7.0),Meter 1,holding,36,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,OBIS 52.7.0. Digits of the read-out value without the decimal point (e.g. 6895.2317 reads 68952317): apply the meter's decimals. 0 if not in the read-out
Voltage L3 (72.7.0),Meter 1,holding,38,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,OBIS 72.7.0. Digits of the read-out value without the decimal point (e.g. 6895.2317 reads 68952317): apply the meter's decimals. 0 if not in the read-out
Power factor (13.7.0),Meter 1,holding,40,int32,,,,R,,,,,,OBIS 13.7.0. Can be negative; the manual lists UInt32. 0 if not in the read-out
Frequency (14.7.0),Meter 1,holding,42,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,OBIS 14.7.0. Digits of the read-out value without the decimal point (e.g. 6895.2317 reads 68952317): apply the meter's decimals. 0 if not in the read-out
Meter number (C.1.0),Meter 1,holding,44,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,OBIS C.1.0. Meter ID / serial number. 0 if not in the read-out
Active power sum A+ - A- (16.7.0),Meter 1,holding,46,int32,,,,R,,,,,,OBIS 16.7.0. Can be negative; the manual lists UInt32. 0 if not in the read-out
Modbus address,Settings,holding,128,uint16,,,,RW,1,247,,,,Gateway slave id; answers the write with the old id
Reading period,Settings,holding,129,uint16,,,s,RW,1,255,,,,Wait after each read attempt (default 10)
Table code,Settings,holding,130,uint16,,,,RW,0,255,,,,ASCII code sent in the IEC 62056-21 option select message (0x30 = '0' default; 0x37 = '7')
Reading method,Settings,holding,131,uint16,,,,RW,0,1,,,@reading_method,Default 1
Init string repeat count,Settings,holding,132,uint16,,,,RW,0,4,,,,Times the init string is sent before the request; 0 = off
Meter count,Settings,holding,133,uint16,,,,RW,1,1,,,,Meters read on the bus (this model reads one meter)
IEC address meter 1,Monitoring,holding,160,uint32,,,,RW,0,4294967295,,,,IEC 62056-21 device address (usually the serial number); 0 = not used. Write with FC16
IEC read counter,Monitoring,holding,162,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,Successful meter reads
Uptime,Monitoring,holding,164,uint32,,,s,R,,,,,,Seconds since power-up; the gateway restarts every 24 h
Firmware original,Monitoring,holding,166,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,0xDDMYYYVV: day byte; month nibble; year 12 bits; version byte
Firmware upgraded,Monitoring,holding,168,uint32,,,,R,,,,,,Same layout as Firmware original; differs after a field upgrade
Init string,Monitoring,holding,170,uint32,,,,RW,0,4294967295,,,,4 wake-up bytes sent before the read-out (needs Init string repeat count >= 1). Write with FC16
